{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras/Gameplay_Gif.gif?t=1752701413\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run, jump, roll.</strong><br>This is a parkour game. But here, it\u2019s not just about obstacles \u2014 you mess with your friends too. Troll them, throw them off balance, get ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online multiplayer for up to 16 players.</strong><br>Play with friends or join an online lobby alone. Chaos and competition are always present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play on different maps.</strong><br>Each map has its own layout and challenges. The pace keeps changing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cosmetics are waiting.</strong><br>Customize your character with outfits and looks. Unlock more by playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple rules, lots of fun.</strong><br>The goal is clear: be the fastest or the funniest. How you play is up to you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669080?t=1752701413","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/1be4e169e1568731086340187504954c8e89a4f1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752701413","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/c5c40929da38f64ec9ea76e1406cd8150d589b1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752701413","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/c5c40929da38f64ec9ea76e1406cd8150d589b1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752701413","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3783760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras/Gameplay_Gif.gif?t=1752701413\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run, jump, roll.</strong><br>This is a parkour game. But here, it\u2019s not just about obstacles \u2014 you mess with your friends too. Troll them, throw them off balance, get ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online multiplayer for up to 16 players.</strong><br>Play with friends or join an online lobby alone. Chaos and competition are always present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play on different maps.</strong><br>Each map has its own layout and challenges. The pace keeps changing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cosmetics are waiting.</strong><br>Customize your character with outfits and looks. Unlock more by playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple rules, lots of fun.</strong><br>The goal is clear: be the fastest or the funniest. How you play is up to you.</p>","developers":["Fleqpe Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/a4f0fc92595821b5da0c13b2609ec0d8b9590897/header.jpg?t=1752701413","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257160810,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257160810/movie